  "question": {
    "text": "A mixture containing the following four compounds is extracted with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCl</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The compound that goes to aqueous layer is:<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0183_a7ed3ab56548.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 310px;\" />"
