  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When the given mixture is shaken with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>amine get protonated and becomes a cation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo></msup></math><br />which does not dissolve in an organic solvent&nbsp;<br />since,&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\st0183_322b3e155b4b.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 146px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0183_a85dc5290f71.png\" style=\"width: 460px; height: 156px;\" /></p>"
